        "en": "Dedicated and compassionate hospital clinicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise veterinary surgeons such as Dr Alba, Dr Stefania, and the nursing team for their empathy, dedication, and clear clinical guidance during stressful visits. Clients appreciate staff who stay calm and supportive when managing critical emergencies. However, several reviewers voiced frustration over administrative disputes and perceived dismissive communication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Emergency trauma outcomes and diagnostics"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous pet parents credit the hospital with saving their animals' lives through urgent surgeries, oxygen therapy, and critical treatments for trauma and sudden illnesses. Conversely, several clients experienced unsatisfactory outcomes, including missed diagnoses, severe medication reactions, or delayed investigations. Overall, opinions on medical results remain mixed."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Continuous twenty-four hour emergency admission"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the security of having round-the-clock veterinary coverage, with pets admitted promptly at night, over weekends, and on bank holidays without prior registration. Reviewers note that immediate triaging and swift hospitalisation proved crucial during sudden crises. The continuous availability remains a vital reassurance for local pet owners."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
