      "q": {
        "en": "Is Medivet Richmond open for emergency veterinary care at night?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the hospital operates 24 hours a day, every day of the year, with clinical veterinary staff on site for immediate emergencies."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do pets need to be previously registered to receive emergency treatment?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "No, reviewers note that the practice promptly admits unregistered pets experiencing acute illnesses or traumatic injuries."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What emergency treatments are carried out at the hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The facility handles emergency surgery, trauma resuscitation, toxic ingestion treatments, diagnostic imaging, and intensive overnight monitoring."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
